# user

Who omega serves. Fill this in - the agent reads it on every start.

- Name: how the user wants to be addressed
- Location / timezone: for scheduling and time-aware answers
- Working style: languages, tools, how they want plans and answers
  (terse vs. explanatory, diffs over descriptions, approval gates)
- Boundaries: what the agent must never do - pushes, destructive
  commands, and topics it should not store or bring up